Third-party components
======================

1. third_party/soap_jax

   SOAP optimizer for JAX, from https://github.com/haydn-jones/SOAP_JAX,
   tag v0.1.0. Copyright (c) 2024 Haydn Jones. MIT License, see
   third_party/soap_jax/LICENSE.

   Modified (src/soap_jax/soap.py; package version 0.1.0+sled; details in
   third_party/soap_jax/README.md):
   - the first moment (exp_avg) is kept in the projected (eigenbasis) space,
     like the second moment;
   - exp_avg is rotated into the new basis whenever the preconditioner is
     refreshed;
   - the bias correction counts from the first real update
     (effective_step = count - 1);
   - weight decay is decoupled (applied after the learning-rate scaling) and
     not applied on the first step.

