3. Rayleigh-Taylor benchmark

   The evaluation window (time_range = (0.1, 0.6)) and the output mesh and
   times (coords, t) of benchmarks/rayleigh_taylor/data/
   rayleigh_taylor_spectral.npy follow the Rayleigh-Taylor example of jaxpi2
   (https://github.com/sifanexisted/jaxpi2, examples/rayleigh_taylor; Apache
   License, Version 2.0). The field values of the file were computed for this
   work (see benchmarks/rayleigh_taylor/data/README_spectral.md).
